Correction to Confusion about the Mylex card (DAC960PDu)

The DEc versions of the Mylex Card are as follows:

KZPAC-xx 1 or 3 channel DAC960PDU with only one Flash Eeprom installed (for
VMS, Tru64 uses V2.49 + V2.70 for 10KRPM disks)

This can be upgraded to a maximum firmware version of 2.73 which is specific
to the intel or older versions of card

FR-PCTAR-Gx  1, 2 and 3 Channel DAC960PDU with both EEPROMS installed (for
NT SCO Unix and Linux)
This is the card needed to fun Alpha Linux

